    "title": "Former DC councilman Jack Evans announces bid for Mendelson's seat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jessica James ,\n1 days ago WASHINGTON (7News) — Former councilmember Jack Evans confirmed to 7News Tuesday that he will run for chairman of the D.C. council. \"I am excited to run for chair of the council of the District of Columbia. I think new leadership is important. I want to focus on education, housing, public safety, education, affordable housing and what I'm known most about is finance,\" Evans said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
